'''Empress' Excavation 4''' (女王の発掘調査４, ''Joō no Hakkutsu Chōsa 4'', '''Queen's Excavation 4''') is an [[Empress' Research]] map unlocked after clearing [[Empress' Excavation 3]]. Just like its predecessor, it has four stages and disappears for the rest of the day after clearing one, so it will take at least 4 days to clear the whole map. Each stage has a different one-time reward, including [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N005]] in stage 4. Once completed, the player will unlock [[Empress' Excavation 5]], which drops another [[Ancient Egg: N006 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N006]]. It was added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]].


